{{!
    @template mod_lightboxgallery/recent_activity_report

    One new gallery comment in the course's recent activity report.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * userpicture - HTML for the author's picture.
    * icon - HTML for the gallery icon, when the report shows details; otherwise empty.
    * url - The comment on its gallery page.
    * preview - The start of the comment, as plain text.
    * profileurl - The author's profile in the course.
    * author - Who made it.
    * date - When it was made.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "userpicture": "<img src=\"https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png\" class=\"userpicture\" alt=\"\">",
        "icon": "",
        "url": "https://example.com/mod/lightboxgallery/view.php?id=5#c12",
        "preview": "Great photos from...",
        "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/view.php?id=3&course=2",
        "author": "Sam Student",
        "date": "Wednesday, 1 October 2026, 2:00 PM"
    }
}}
<div class="mod-lightboxgallery-recent d-flex mb-2">
    <div class="userpicture me-2">{{{userpicture}}}</div>
    <div>
        <div class="title">{{{icon}}}<a href="{{url}}">{{preview}}</a></div>
        <div class="user"><a href="{{profileurl}}">{{author}}</a> - {{date}}</div>
    </div>
</div>
